;; eww config for the xfce hosts — merge of two upstream repos:
;;   bar        -> Saimoomedits/eww-widgets (eww/bar, bspwm-era, ported to xfwm4)
;;   gross      -> iSparsh/gross (searchapps + bigpowermenu + appbar widgets)
;; Both scripts were rewritten for NixOS/XFCE; palette = ayu-dark to match the
;; GTK theme + old polybar/rofi look (see xfce.nix history).
;; Repo files were inlined rather than vendored wholesale because upstream
;; conficts: gross assumes Arch (/usr/bin, pacman, yay), the bar assumes
;; bspwm (bspc query/subscribe), and neither runs under XFCE unchanged.

(include "eww_variables.yuck")
(include "eww_widgets.yuck")
(include "bar.yuck")
(include "eww_windows.yuck")
